      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹37.54 (up from ₹33.30 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹31.7b (up 13% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹4.16b (up 13% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 13% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 1.9%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 4.3%. Revenue is forecast to grow 9.9% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Machinery industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 2% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 3% per year.",
